            <ArticleTitle>In situ coronary-coronary bypass grafting for a huge left coronary aneurysm.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>622-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.5761/atcs.cr.13-00101</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Surgical treatment for an atherosclerotic huge coronary aneurysm is very rare. We have reported 58 years old male who had a huge growing aneurysm in left circumflex coronary artery and underwent aneurysmectomy and coronary-coronary bypass grafting with saphenous vein.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
